      <uei>uei.opennms.org/traps/NSN-SNMP-NBI-TOPOLOGY-MIB/nbiCreateNotification</uei>
      <event-label>NSN-SNMP-NBI-TOPOLOGY-MIB defined trap event: nbiCreateNotification</event-label>
      <descr>This notification is sent by the SNMP Agent each time a new network resource is taken into service (i.e. is managed by NetAct).</descr>
