      <uei>uei.opennms.org/traps/NSN-SNMP-NBI-TOPOLOGY-MIB/nbiSyncEMSDataNotification</uei>
      <event-label>NSN-SNMP-NBI-TOPOLOGY-MIB defined trap event: nbiSyncEMSDataNotification</event-label>
      <descr>This notification is sent by the SNMP Agent for each managed network resource as result of a previous nbiGetTopologyData NMS request. It provides to NMS the capability to update its topology information about the managed network. </descr>
